$\begin{aligned} \text { Work done by electric field }=& \begin{array}{l}\text { Change in KE of } \\ \text { electron }\end{array} \end{aligned}$
or $\mathrm{qE} x=\frac{1}{2} \mathrm{mv}^{2}$
